 "intro_html": "The salmon goes <b>through</b> the rice; the <b>ikura</b> sits in the <b>center</b>. Salted salmon grilled until just flaking and still juicy, folded into hot rice with shiso, shio kombu and sesame. When you shape, press a well, spoon in the cold ikura, and close the rice over it. Shaping basics are on the <a href=\"onigiri.html\">onigiri page</a>.",
