    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"300\">300 ml</span>",
     "name_html": "Water (rice)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Sprinkle the sake over the salmon, turn it to coat and leave it 10 minutes. Pat dry with a paper towel.</li><li>Sprinkle the salt over the skin and both sides.</li><li>On a paper towel, skin side up, in the fridge for 20–30 minutes. Pat it dry again.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-2",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Salt the salmon",
