   "time_html": "<span>~8–10 min</span>",
   "title": "Grill — stop while it's juicy",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Let it cool a minute, then peel off the skin.</li><li>Flake the flesh with chopsticks or a fork into <b>big, juicy flakes</b>, picking out any bones.</li><li>Chop the crisp skin into small bits — it goes into the rice for crunch.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
