  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut the stems off the shiso, stack and roll the leaves from the stem end, slice into thin strips and loosen them.</li><li>Halve the myoga lengthwise and slice thinly (skip it if you can't find it).</li></ul>",
