    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"3\" data-n=\"1\">3</span>",
     "name_html": "Myoga ginger (optional)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Tip the hot rice into a large bowl or tray so there's room to mix.</li><li>Scatter over it:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>shiso</li><li>myoga</li><li>shio kombu (salted kelp strips) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1.5\">1½ tbsp</span></span></li><li>toasted white sesame seeds <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"2\">2 tsp</span></span></li><li>the salmon flakes and chopped skin</li></ul></li><li>Fold with the rice paddle in <b>slicing</b> strokes until everything is evenly through — don't mash the grains. No ikura yet.</li><li>Let it cool a few minutes, until you can hold it.</li></ul>",
